whisper: Lesson 7: Your own kinds of things
whisper:
whisper: Sometimes a few values belong together. A pet has a name and an age, say.
whisper: "a pet has:" describes that, and "conjure a pet" makes a new one.
whisper: After that, "the name of rex" is rex's name. You can set it and read it like any other name.
whisper:
whisper: Your turn: give pets a sound too, set rex's sound to "woof", and add a line
whisper: that says "Rex says woof".

a pet has:
  name (text)
  age (a number)
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  conjure a pet as rex
  set the name of rex to "Rex"
  set the age of rex to 3
  scrawl rex
  scrawl the name of rex, " is ", the age of rex, " years old."
and the universe said i love you
